            {
              "id": "1773541721921_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "TASK: Generate a Power Point Presentation\n\nInitialize the communication generation for a PPT performance report with one slide per employee. \n{\n    \"templateId\": \"2367baa2-dbdd-40d7-b93d-b6a577261a69\", \n    \"type\": \"ppt\",\n     \"title\": \"Team Performance Report\"\n}\n\nPrepare a data context combining performance ratings and risk of loss for each of the team member. \nThe context should be an array of employee objects with fields: Employee DisplayName, ManagerRatingDescription of 'Overall summary' section, RiskLossRatingDescription, and Also, show bulleted list of Strengths and Development needs as two separate sections based on the ManagerCommentText and WorkerCommentText.\n\nInput:\n{{$context.$nodes.TEAM_RATINGS.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
